    "slug": "how-to-get-your-first-paying-customer",
    "title": "How Do I Get My First Paying Customer?",
    "problem": "You have built something, or are about to, and nobody has ever given you money for it.",
    "maslowLevel": "safety",
    "guideSlug": "todd-graves",
    "guideReason": "He funded his first restaurant on a fishing boat after every bank in Louisiana said no, so he treats selling as the founder's job and asks how badly you actually want it.",
