    "slug": "how-to-stop-fighting-yourself",
    "title": "How Do I Stop Fighting Myself to Get Things Done?",
    "problem": "You know what you should be doing, you are not doing it, and every attempt to force yourself has turned into a fight you keep losing.",
    "maslowLevel": "esteem",
    "guideSlug": "lulie-tanett",
    "guideReason": "She wrote the argument that discipline is internal conflict rather than a virtue, and she will look for the disagreement inside you instead of handing you another system to obey.",
